# Local working copy of the dkfans/FXGraphics source-art repo (the raw PNGs
# `make pkg-gfx`/`pkg-enginegfx` build the .dat/.tab sprite sheets from, and
# the reuse source for frontend chrome -- see
# docs/refactor/renderer/04-imgui-gui-foundation.md §5.1). Cloned/unpacked
# here by hand; same treatment as the other game-data folders above.
/FXGraphics-main/
/FXGraphics/
/tools/peresec
/tools/png2bestpal
/tools/png2ico
/tools/pngpal2raw
/tools/po2ngdat
/tools/rnctools
/tools/sndbanker
/config/fxdata/*.dat
/config/fxdata/*.fon
.vs/
# Build output directories (build/ itself now holds tracked CMake modules under
# build/cmake/, so ignore only alternative output dirs, not build/).
/build-*/
/out/*
# Ad-hoc/alternate CMake BUILD_DIR overrides (e.g. `BUILD_DIR=out_foo
# ./build-cmake.sh`, verification builds) -- distinct from /out/* above so
# these are ignored outright rather than just their contents.
/out_*/
# build-cmake.sh's post-build `cmake --install` convenience copy
# (dist/<platform>/keeperfx[.exe] + runtime libs).
/dist/
*.cache
.vscode
# JetBrains IDE project state (CLion/IntelliJ) -- same treatment as .vscode
# above; personal editor config, not shared project config.
.idea/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Scratch/manual build output outside the documented build-cmake.sh/Makefile
# output dirs.
/tmp/
/libexterns
docs/html
docs/latex
*.o
*.d
*.Tpo
res/keeperfx_icon.ico
.header_checksum
/deps/enet
/deps/enet6
/deps/libcurl
/deps/zlib
/deps/spng
/deps/astronomy
/deps/centijson
/deps/ffmpeg
/deps/openal
/deps/luajit
/deps/miniupnpc
/deps/libnatpmp
/deps/*.tar.gz
# CMake's own fetches (build/cmake/modules/Dependencies.cmake): every
# third-party dependency's download+build output, kept outside out/<platform>
# so deleting that build tree doesn't force a re-download/rebuild from
# source of ffmpeg/curl/openal/luajit/etc. too. One dir per platform (mingw32
# cross-compile vs native lin64) since they use different toolchains for the
# same dependencies, same reasoning /out/* needs separate linux/windows trees.
/deps/.cache-mingw32/
/deps/.cache-lin64/
/deps/*-mingw32
/deps/*-mingw32.tar.gz
/deps/*-mingw
/deps/*-mingw.tar.gz
/deps/*-lin64.tar.gz
/cppcheck.cache
/src/ver_defs.h
# CMakeLists.txt generates this one at the source root, not src/ (pre-existing
# behavior, not something this refactor changed) -- distinct path, so it
# needs its own ignore entry alongside the one above.
/ver_defs.h
keeperfx.log
crash_log.txt
debug.log
# Local staging of the real, proprietary Dungeon Keeper data files (not
# ours to distribute -- see CLAUDE.md/src/ftests/README.md) used to run
# src/ftests/ and the KFX_FUNCTESTING+KFX_TEST_COVERAGE `coverage` target
# locally.
/core_files/
.local/
.vscode/compile_and_copy_files.ps1
third_party/
/keeperfx_vs2010

# Local-only design notes; removed from the remote (to be folded into docs/Architecture)
/docs/refactor/
